Cell["\<\
Quotients of an exact Bishop\[Dash]Gromov form, dimension 2 and curvature \
0.1, give those numbers back.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"f13c9b52-9fe1-4e90-b8b4-1fb707952ee5"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"DimensionCurvatureFit", "[", 
  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"2", " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{"0.1", " ", "r", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"r", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ")"}], "/", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"3", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"2", " ", "+", " ", "2"}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}]}]}]}], "}"}], 
    ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"r", ",", " ", "3", ",", " ", "10"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"a671d843-aa0b-4bde-9ed3-bc9af0cfcfea"],

